<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mosaix rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mosaix rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany said analyst Herbert Tinger initiated coverage of Mosaix Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.07 per share for 1997 and $1.33 for 1998 versus $0.91 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $26. Shares closed at 11-1/4 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
